{"id": "t046-001", "text": "Coffee with Suzanne and Carlos. They've finally set a date, 14 August 2027, at a vineyard near Porto. Suzanne's sister Hana is maid of honour. Carlos is weirdly calm about it, Suzanne less so. Her mum is flying over from Lyon the week before to help with the flowers, and Carlos's parents are hosting a dinner the night before. Should ask Suzanne what's on the gift list.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "set a date", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 August 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "less so", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Lyon", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Suzanne what's on the gift list", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t046-003", "text": "Kavya and Eli viewed a flat in Leith on Saturday. Two bed, top floor, no lift. They're putting in an offer Monday. Eli's already measuring for a piano that doesn't fit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewed a flat in Leith", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Two bed, top floor, no lift", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t046-004", "text": "Dorota's surgery went fine apparently, gallbladder out last Thursday. She's home now but not allowed to lift anything for six weeks. Her husband Bruno is doing all the cooking, which she finds hilarious.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not allowed to lift anything", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "finds hilarious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t046-005", "text": "Ran into Thomas at the station. He's moving to Glasgow in January 2027 for the new job at the university. His partner Wei is staying here until the summer to finish her contract. Long distance for six months, he seems fine with it. He's flying back most weekends. Wei's birthday is in February and he's already planning to surprise her with a trip to Skye.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the university", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "contract", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Long distance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Skye", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t046-008", "text": "Ibrahim's mum had a fall and she's in St Thomas' for at least a week. He's going in every evening after work. Don't forget to ring him at the weekend and see how he's holding up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in St Thomas'", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "at least a week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t046-009", "text": "Gemma and Dafydd's tenth anniversary is 3 March 2027. She wants to go back to the hotel in Tenby where they had their honeymoon. Dafydd has no idea she's planning it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go back to the hotel in Tenby", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "honeymoon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t046-011", "text": "Uma's scan is on the 12th. She's nervous, last one showed something they wanted to recheck. I'll drive her, appointment's at 9:40.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9:40", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t046-013", "text": "Meera called from the new place in Manchester. Boxes everywhere, the cat Biscuit hid under the bath for two days. Her housewarming is 22 November, I said I'd bring wine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two days"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 November", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t046-017", "text": "Fatima's dad is out of hospital after the bypass. Came home on Tuesday, physio starts the week after. Fatima took the whole week off to be with him. Her brother Tariq flew in from Dubai the day before the op and is staying till the 1st.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Came home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flew in from Dubai", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before the op", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the 1st", "anchor": "e5"}]}
{"id": "t046-018", "text": "Lunch with Aditi. She's been offered a transfer to the Singapore office starting April 2027, hasn't decided. Her husband would need to find work out there. She's also got her sister's wedding in December so it's all a lot at once. I should check in with her next week, she looked stressed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer to the Singapore office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t046-019", "text": "Damian's moving in with Hana! Keys on 5 December. He's selling the flat in Leeds, she's keeping hers in York for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the flat in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeping hers in York", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t046-023", "text": "Wei's been offered a flat in Lisbon through work. She flies out 9 January for two viewings and decides the week after. Her dog Pepper would have to go in the hold, which she hates the idea of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewings", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decides", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the idea of", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t046-026", "text": "Tariq is very into bouldering now. Goes four times a week, wants to try outdoor in the Peak District next spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to try outdoor in the Peak District", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring"}]}
{"id": "t046-030", "text": "Dinner with Ibrahim and Fatima. They're getting married 20 June 2027 in Leicester, then a second celebration in Lahore later that summer. Fatima wants a small one, Ibrahim's family wants 400 guests. Ibrahim's brother Hamza is best man. We laughed a lot about the seating plan. Need to save the date in the calendar.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "20 June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second celebration in Lahore", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "later that summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a small one", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants 400 guests", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "save the date in the calendar", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t046-033", "text": "Note to self: Lila said her uncle Dafydd is retiring at Christmas after 35 years at the council. Party is the Friday before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years at the council", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t046-034", "text": "Uma and Cem had their first viewing together this morning. Flat in Walthamstow, nice but tiny. Second one is Saturday, then they'll decide by the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first viewing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Second one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the month", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t046-035", "text": "Chat with Mrs Okafor next door. Her son Kevin is getting married in Lagos on 19 December 2026 and she's flying out a week before to help. She asked if I'd water the plants while she's gone.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Okafor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Lagos", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's gone"}]}
{"id": "t046-037", "text": "Thomas was saying his sister Meera is getting married next spring, probably April. Thomas is giving a speech and is already terrified.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t046-040", "text": "Bumped into Aditi and her husband at the hospital car park. Her father-in-law had a stent put in this morning, all went well. They're staying near the hospital tonight and heading home the next day. Aditi said her mother-in-law has been a wreck all week. Their kids are with Aditi's sister Meera. Need to drop round some food at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stent put in", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t046-041", "text": "Kevin mentioned he hates house moves, has done six in five years. Swears this one in Bath is the last. Moving on 1 December, his partner Gemma is handling the solicitors. Their kids start at the new school after Christmas. He also said his back has been bad since the last move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates house moves", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "back has been bad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the last move"}]}
{"id": "t046-043", "text": "Called off: Damian's trip to see the flat in Berlin. His landlord over there pulled out last minute. He's looking at Hamburg now instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last minute"}]}
{"id": "t046-044", "text": "Yetunde got the keys today!! First house, in Peckham. Moving in on 15 November. Her mum Dr Ahmed is helping paint the weekend before. Buy her a plant for the new place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the keys", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "First house, in Peckham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Ahmed", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Buy her a plant for the new place", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t046-051", "text": "Cem's mum had cataract surgery on her left eye last month, the right one is booked for January. She's doing really well, already back to reading.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "right one", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "reading", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t046-052", "text": "Spoke to Bruno re his sister Uma's wedding in Florence, 11 September 2027. He's sorting the stag. Said Uma's fiancé Xavier wants something low-key, golf maybe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding in Florence", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11 September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants something low-key, golf maybe", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t046-056", "text": "Kavya's brother Sam is moving back from Toronto in the spring, March 2027-ish. He'll stay with Kavya and Eli until he finds a place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back from Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027-ish", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until he finds a place"}]}
{"id": "t046-058", "text": "Remind me: Hamza's anniversary dinner is the 23rd, booked the table for him and Zara at Dishoom as a surprise. Pick up the voucher the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up the voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t046-059", "text": "Quick note after the call with Ibrahim. He's recovering from a broken ankle, cast comes off on 10 November. Then physio for a month. He's going stir crazy at home, binge watching snooker.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken ankle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cast comes off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "10 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stir crazy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "snooker", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t046-060", "text": "Hana and her fiancé Damian Moreau have pushed the wedding to October 2027 because of the house move. They're relocating to Bristol in spring, both found jobs there. Damian's brother Kevin is gutted, he'd already booked flights for the original date in May. Hana is relieved actually, said the last few months were too much.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian Moreau", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to October 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocating to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "found jobs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last few months"}]}
